fixture safe_ground_never_on_wax
doc (movement review 4, M3) a kindle down-dash burns a wax bridge over spikes that Ash stood on and falls into the spikes. Safe ground is never noted on a box the game can take away, so the send-back goes to ground that is still there, not the bridge's old top over the spikes (which made an endless respawn loop with no input).
room test/wax_bridge_spikes
spawn 200 320
option kindle 1
frames 400
input
  0..50 R
  51..60
  61..75 jump
  76 D dash
  77..399
end
expect
  at 60 ground=1
  mark lit 76..90 event.ignite=1
  mark die1 lit..399 event.hazard=1
  # Back on ground that is still there, never on the burnt bridge's old top: no second fall.
  at die1 ground=1
  never die1+1..399 event.hazard=1
end
